I am finally back in my flat.
I take off my jacket and my shoes.
Then I go straight into the kitchen.
I unpack the groceries.
Today I am cooking pasta with vegetables.
First, I wash the fresh vegetables.
I cut everything into small pieces.
Then I boil the water for the pasta.
I prepare a simple vegetable sauce.
That only takes twenty minutes.
Dinner is ready.
I sit down at the table.
I am looking forward to the hot food.
The pasta tastes really good.
The flat is nice and warm and very quiet.
I eat slowly and relax.
I enjoy the quiet evening.
